We want to find the coefficient of $x^3$ in the expansion of $f(x)$.
We can compute the determinant by expanding along the first row:
\begin{align*} f(x) &= x \left|\begin{array}{ccc}x & 2 & -1 \\ 1 & x & 1 \\ -1 & 1 & x\end{array}\right| - x \left|\begin{array}{ccc}1 & 2 & -1 \\ 2 & x & 1 \\ 2 & 1 & x\end{array}\right| + 1 \left|\begin{array}{ccc}1 & x & -1 \\ 2 & 1 & 1 \\ 2 & -1 & x\end{array}\right| - 2x \left|\begin{array}{ccc}1 & x & 2 \\ 2 & 1 & 1 \\ 2 & -1 & x\end{array}\right| \end{align*}
